  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Livelihoods Resilience Programme (RLRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RLRP?s development objective is to sustainably increase productivity, incomes and nutrition security and enhance resilience of rural smallholder families in Somalia. It aims to address the challenges underlying the fragility of the agricultural sector in Somalia, e.g. vulnerability to climate change, perpetuating severe water scarcity, violent conflicts leading to displacement of farmers and inadequate access to food, poor access to rural and agricultural production infrastructure and services, limited access to skills training.</narrative>
  </description>
